The comparison logic:
- parse `<h1 class="title ...">Title</h1>` — arXiv abs pages: `<h1 class="title mathjax"><span class="descriptor">Title:</span>...</h1>`.
- authors: `<div class="authors"><span class="descriptor">Authors:</span> <a href="...">Name</a>, ...</div>`.
- abstract: `<blockquote class="abstract mathjax"><span class="descriptor">Abstract:</span> text </blockquote>`.
